WEBVTT

00:55.990 --> 00:58.868
FILING FOR LOVE

01:18.345 --> 01:19.346
Bye, then.

01:19.638 --> 01:21.056
Would you like some coffee?

01:21.474 --> 01:22.641
No. It's late.

01:22.975 --> 01:25.144
Have a cup of cold water, then.

01:25.227 --> 01:26.520
You must be exhausted.

01:33.402 --> 01:34.737
He's pretty hefty.

01:35.988 --> 01:37.364
You're quite strong.

01:38.866 --> 01:40.326
I do what must be done.

01:40.659 --> 01:41.702
Thanks for the water.

01:46.957 --> 01:49.210
Ki-jun and I live together.

01:51.587 --> 01:52.963
It would seem so.

01:53.047 --> 01:54.131
Don't get the wrong idea.

01:54.215 --> 01:57.218
I asked to stay just for a while
due to some personal reasons.

01:57.301 --> 01:58.552
Ki-jun and I are just...

01:59.261 --> 02:00.262
We're just friends.

02:00.554 --> 02:01.555
For now, that is.

02:02.848 --> 02:04.517
We used to date for a bit.

02:06.644 --> 02:07.645
I see.

02:10.397 --> 02:12.733
Thanks. Sorry for the late intrusion.

02:38.259 --> 02:39.426
What are you doing, Joo In-a?

02:40.970 --> 02:42.012
Get a hold of yourself.

02:48.310 --> 02:51.772
EPISODE 6:
CAN'T YOU

02:53.440 --> 02:54.733
Noh Ki-jun, wake up.

02:55.025 --> 02:57.152
You can share my taxi
if you get ready in ten minutes.

02:57.278 --> 02:59.196
My headache's killing me.

03:00.364 --> 03:01.699
How did I get home last night?

03:02.866 --> 03:03.909
You just did.

03:05.953 --> 03:07.371
You got back in a pretty state.

03:08.872 --> 03:10.499
My homing instinct never fails.

03:11.750 --> 03:13.752
Good for me. Well done.

03:18.215 --> 03:21.010
I'll get out over there.
You get out at the main entrance.

03:21.385 --> 03:22.553
No, it's fine.

03:23.387 --> 03:24.930
Let's just go straight to work.

03:26.390 --> 03:28.559
What's the occasion?
I don't mind this at all.

03:29.393 --> 03:30.477
Okay, then.

03:39.903 --> 03:40.904
Ms. Joo.

03:41.697 --> 03:42.698
Good morning.

03:44.366 --> 03:45.409
Hello.

03:50.539 --> 03:52.082
Did you get home safe last night?

03:53.584 --> 03:56.086
Oh, we had a team dinner.

03:59.340 --> 04:01.634
Yes, I got back just fine,
thanks to you.

04:02.551 --> 04:04.386
- How do you feel...
- Ki-jun?

04:12.019 --> 04:13.103
What's this on you?

04:13.312 --> 04:15.606
You can't look disheveled
in front of your head.

04:16.815 --> 04:18.275
Don't you agree, Ms. Joo?

04:20.527 --> 04:22.905
Well,
I've already seen him disheveled.

04:31.372 --> 04:32.373
What was that about?

04:40.381 --> 04:43.175
What do you think got into her?
Did she eat something weird?

04:43.676 --> 04:45.678
Did you hear about Mr. Do
from Haemu Cosmetics?

04:46.470 --> 04:47.680
Yes.

04:47.763 --> 04:49.723
I'll charge him with assault
and demoralizing behavior

04:49.807 --> 04:51.141
and apply for disciplinary action.

04:51.225 --> 04:52.685
A few of his client companies

04:52.768 --> 04:55.354
severed business ties
due to Mr. Do's actions.

04:55.437 --> 04:56.772
It's a sizable loss.

04:56.855 --> 04:58.649
Consult our Legal Team
and consider firing him, too.

04:59.274 --> 05:00.359
I'll do that.

05:01.527 --> 05:03.821
How do you feel, Ms. Joo?

05:04.321 --> 05:05.698
Shouldn't you take a break?

05:06.573 --> 05:09.118
- How about taking the afternoon...
- I'm fine. I'm good.

05:09.368 --> 05:11.161
Could I have become
Haemu's youngest female executive

05:11.245 --> 05:13.789
if I had to take the afternoon
after just a few drinks?

05:14.373 --> 05:15.833
I'm Joo In-a.

05:16.083 --> 05:17.876
Something like that
will never make me...

05:24.091 --> 05:25.384
I will never waver.

05:27.261 --> 05:28.387
Got it.

05:30.931 --> 05:31.932
Respect.

05:52.786 --> 05:55.205
Yes, looking good.

05:56.248 --> 05:57.875
The last frame.

06:00.878 --> 06:02.713
You're doing great, PK.

06:02.796 --> 06:05.048
The photos are amazing.

06:05.257 --> 06:07.926
- What time is it?
- It's a little after 9 p.m.

06:08.010 --> 06:10.429
What? Darn it.

06:11.430 --> 06:13.182
- I'm leaving.
- Where to?

06:13.515 --> 06:15.142
Sort things out for me.
She's waiting.

06:15.225 --> 06:18.061
We still have
a few more outfits to shoot.

06:18.353 --> 06:19.772
PK, where are you going?

06:42.961 --> 06:44.213
What should we do later?

06:44.296 --> 06:45.380
What do you want to do?

06:46.507 --> 06:47.758
Don't get too jumpy.

06:48.175 --> 06:51.220
No, don't. I'm driving right now.

06:59.728 --> 07:01.271
- Hold back.
- What for?

07:01.355 --> 07:03.816
- We have lots of time.
- Kiss me.

07:03.899 --> 07:05.734
- Come on.
- I'm driving.

07:05.818 --> 07:07.194
- We stopped.
- Later.

07:07.277 --> 07:09.112
- No, I want it now.
- Wait.

07:09.196 --> 07:11.615
- Hang on. I really...
- No. Now.

07:14.743 --> 07:15.953
What the heck?

07:17.454 --> 07:18.455
Hey, you!

07:20.123 --> 07:22.751
- Who was that?
- You're dead meat.

07:28.173 --> 07:31.009
Step on it. He's getting away.

07:31.802 --> 07:33.095
He won't stop?

07:33.387 --> 07:35.222
This is so much fun.

07:45.357 --> 07:47.442
Keep going. Catch him.

07:47.860 --> 07:50.279
I want to drive, too.

07:50.362 --> 07:51.613
This is fun!

07:58.954 --> 08:00.414
Pull over!

08:00.747 --> 08:02.457
Who are you to take photos?

08:02.541 --> 08:04.126
You! Pull over!

08:12.801 --> 08:15.053
- Darn it.
- Shoot.

08:15.137 --> 08:16.722
We're done for.

08:17.097 --> 08:18.223
What happened?

08:18.432 --> 08:20.267
- Oh, my gosh.
- What the...

08:21.351 --> 08:22.769
I don't believe this.

08:23.228 --> 08:24.897
Are we done for?

08:25.397 --> 08:26.481
Come on out.

08:26.565 --> 08:28.984
- Shoot.
- We're screwed.

08:30.444 --> 08:32.529
Top star singer and actor PK

08:32.613 --> 08:36.950
caused a traffic accident
in a main street late last night.

08:37.034 --> 08:39.119
Reports say it wasn't just a mistake.

08:39.202 --> 08:42.915
He gave chase and drove
into another car deliberately.

08:42.998 --> 08:44.124
Everyone's reeling in shock.

08:44.207 --> 08:45.208
PK, A MIDNIGHT CHASE

08:45.292 --> 08:47.669
Experts say PK
will have to pay a penalty

08:47.753 --> 08:50.547
reaching tens of billions of won
for his commercial deals.

08:50.631 --> 08:52.966
The industry is also in turmoil.

08:53.050 --> 08:54.551
STRIVING FOR THE FUTURE

08:54.635 --> 08:57.012
Come on. PK.

08:57.763 --> 08:59.932
Why did you go and do that?

09:00.015 --> 09:01.934
With your handsome face.

09:05.896 --> 09:09.274
- You're a fan of PK?
- Yes, a die-hard fan.

09:09.608 --> 09:12.945
I used to collect PR material for her
if PK was on them.

09:17.032 --> 09:19.368
Does that mean
he's done being our company's model?

09:23.830 --> 09:25.540
- Mr. Moo.
- Yes?

09:25.624 --> 09:27.834
Can I go get a sugar boost?

09:28.251 --> 09:29.836
I have zero will to work right now.

09:29.920 --> 09:32.881
Yes, sure. Get some fresh
and gather yourself.

09:38.220 --> 09:41.515
Why would someone stan
a celebrity at that age?

09:42.349 --> 09:43.600
Don't you agree, Ms. Yoon?

09:43.684 --> 09:45.268
Some people are like that.

09:45.352 --> 09:47.646
Is there a star you like, Ms. Yoon?

09:47.729 --> 09:50.899
Do you think she's the type
to care about celebrities?

09:51.149 --> 09:53.777
She went to a prestigious university
and passed the accountant exam.

09:53.860 --> 09:55.946
- Oh, right.
- She did nothing but study

09:56.029 --> 09:58.323
with no distractions, right?

09:59.282 --> 10:01.576
Look. We're talking about her

10:01.660 --> 10:04.538
and she's concentrating on her work
without minding us.

10:04.621 --> 10:06.665
- She'll be really successful.
- I'm jealous.

10:16.133 --> 10:17.926
NEW MESSAGE
FROM SHIN JI-HYE OF MARKETING

10:20.429 --> 10:22.305
Ki-jun, are you busy?

10:25.100 --> 10:27.561
The wedding invitation looks great.
Congratulations.

10:28.645 --> 10:29.688
Thanks.

10:30.981 --> 10:32.899
Ki-jun, the thing is...

10:33.734 --> 10:35.444
I want to apologize.

10:36.903 --> 10:40.115
For what I did to you
in the stairwell.

10:40.866 --> 10:42.534
I came onto you.

10:45.912 --> 10:48.123
Maybe I have wedding jitters,
like you said.

10:48.206 --> 10:51.084
I've learned my lesson
and turned over a new leaf.

10:51.460 --> 10:53.128
I'll be true and loyal to my husband.

10:53.211 --> 10:55.213
Good. You made the right call.

10:55.297 --> 10:56.423
Live happily ever after.

10:58.467 --> 10:59.926
How are the preparations going?

11:00.594 --> 11:02.471
I'm more worried about my workload.

11:02.554 --> 11:04.056
I hope I'll be done
before the wedding.

11:04.723 --> 11:08.018
Oh, it's because PK messed up, right?

11:08.727 --> 11:11.271
Finding another company model
will be a lot of work.

11:11.646 --> 11:14.399
No, we're not replacing him.

11:14.483 --> 11:16.568
- You're not?
- My team leader put it on hold.

11:17.110 --> 11:19.821
The investigation's still underway,
so she wants to wait.

11:19.905 --> 11:22.491
Why wait?
Isn't a model all about image?

11:22.949 --> 11:24.076
I can't say.

11:24.785 --> 11:27.162
PK is still huge abroad.

11:28.747 --> 11:31.666
To be honest, I don't get it, either.

11:32.334 --> 11:33.627
Does PK have connections?

11:34.503 --> 11:35.629
You think so?

11:44.096 --> 11:45.597
Congrats anyway.
See you at the wedding.

11:45.680 --> 11:46.681
Okay.

11:48.266 --> 11:50.560
Ms. Joo,
did you have a meeting elsewhere?

11:51.228 --> 11:52.938
You must have no work to do.

11:53.021 --> 11:56.108
Do you have time to enjoy
a coffee break during work hours?

11:56.191 --> 11:58.610
That's how I gather information.

11:58.944 --> 12:01.029
I think I got something big.

12:01.113 --> 12:03.031
I'm not sure if it's a PM case

12:03.115 --> 12:05.242
but my experience tells me
there's more to it.

12:07.494 --> 12:08.495
What is it about?

12:11.248 --> 12:12.374
You know PK, right?

12:19.881 --> 12:22.592
These are all the files
on our company model contracts

12:22.676 --> 12:24.052
going back five years.

12:27.097 --> 12:29.349
Not just signed contracts
but step-by-step reports

12:29.432 --> 12:31.101
minutes, internal memos, invoices

12:31.184 --> 12:34.146
emails that went to and fro
are right here.

12:34.437 --> 12:37.065
Read everything thoroughly
and check for discrepancies.

12:38.608 --> 12:42.696
- I only wanted to look into PK...
- You have a prejudice about him.

12:42.779 --> 12:45.073
That could
make this investigation biased.

12:45.907 --> 12:47.701
And we should compare PK's deal

12:47.784 --> 12:49.870
with that of other models'
to find out if there's a problem.

12:50.120 --> 12:51.163
Right?

12:51.538 --> 12:53.874
Let's get it done ASAP.

13:07.512 --> 13:09.973
How many times must I say I won't go?

13:10.557 --> 13:13.393
Why should I go just to watch
some old folk brag?

13:13.476 --> 13:15.187
I told you about it for a whole month

13:15.270 --> 13:17.772
that it's an important event
and you shouldn't drink before going.

13:18.982 --> 13:20.233
So what?

13:20.609 --> 13:22.152
I'm drinking already.

13:27.949 --> 13:29.868
You're an alcoholic.

13:30.619 --> 13:31.661
You need help.

13:38.919 --> 13:40.378
Sorry for laughing.

13:45.926 --> 13:47.093
What?

13:49.763 --> 13:50.847
Are you afraid?

13:52.182 --> 13:54.351
That I'll go crazy like your mom?

14:01.608 --> 14:02.651
Hey.

14:05.070 --> 14:06.863
I told you not to give me that look.

14:11.493 --> 14:13.411
Don't look at me like that!

14:46.278 --> 14:48.196
- Ms. Han.
- Yes?

14:48.280 --> 14:49.990
Are you not picking up
your kids today?

14:50.073 --> 14:53.118
I should leave soon. You go ahead.

14:54.995 --> 14:56.371
Weddings are hard to plan, right?

14:56.454 --> 14:58.331
There's so much to do.

14:58.415 --> 15:00.250
Tell me if you need help
with anything.

15:00.333 --> 15:02.711
- I will. Thank you.
- Go on home.

15:04.462 --> 15:06.881
- See you tomorrow.
- Bye.

15:54.095 --> 15:55.597
What took you so long?

15:55.680 --> 15:58.016
Come here.
You kept me waiting a while.

16:08.860 --> 16:10.904
Why are you going back inside?
Do you have to stay late?

16:17.202 --> 16:18.828
Why do you
keep talking to me at work?

16:18.912 --> 16:20.538
You used to want me to stay away.

16:20.955 --> 16:22.916
And why did you fix my tie yesterday

16:22.999 --> 16:24.793
in front of Ms. Joo in the elevator?

16:24.876 --> 16:26.336
You gave me a real scare.

16:26.419 --> 16:28.963
Why are you overreacting?

16:29.339 --> 16:31.633
Is there a reason
Joo In-a can't know?

16:31.716 --> 16:32.717
About us?

16:33.301 --> 16:35.762
No, I'm saying
we should be careful around everyone.

16:36.346 --> 16:37.389
Too bad.

16:38.390 --> 16:40.141
Joo In-a knows already.

16:42.352 --> 16:45.105
That we're living together.

16:47.315 --> 16:49.317
- What do you mean?
- Two days ago.

16:49.401 --> 16:52.237
She brought you home
the night you got drunk.

16:52.320 --> 16:53.363
What?

16:56.533 --> 16:57.909
Why are you telling me that now?

16:57.992 --> 17:00.745
I didn't know
it meant so much to you.

17:04.374 --> 17:06.292
Did you tell her
that there's nothing between us?

17:06.376 --> 17:07.752
I told her exactly how things are.

17:08.962 --> 17:10.171
That we used to date.

17:26.312 --> 17:27.480
What's her problem?

17:52.964 --> 17:54.132
Ms. Joo.

17:54.799 --> 17:56.134
Didn't you go home?

17:56.217 --> 17:58.720
I came back
for something I'd forgotten.

17:59.053 --> 18:00.430
Are you finished with this pile?

18:00.513 --> 18:02.223
I don't mind working on it alone.

18:02.307 --> 18:04.434
Let's not waste company funds
on too much overtime.

18:17.238 --> 18:18.490
Did you have dinner?

18:19.491 --> 18:20.492
Would you like to have this?

18:21.326 --> 18:22.327
No.

18:23.203 --> 18:24.204
Okay.

18:35.882 --> 18:39.052
I heard you took me home.

18:39.636 --> 18:42.222
Yes, you should lose some weight.

18:43.806 --> 18:47.185
I weigh more than I look
because I'm pure muscle.

18:58.863 --> 19:01.282
Ms. Park and I are just friends.

19:01.866 --> 19:03.326
We have in separate rooms

19:03.409 --> 19:05.495
and we barely meet at home
because we're both so busy.

19:05.787 --> 19:08.414
Our arrangement
is more like what housemates...

19:08.498 --> 19:09.541
Mr. Noh.

19:09.624 --> 19:11.668
You don't have to explain that to me.

19:12.794 --> 19:14.087
It's your private life.

19:19.551 --> 19:21.344
Don't you care about my private life?

19:22.428 --> 19:23.555
We even kissed.

19:27.684 --> 19:28.851
I don't care.

19:29.310 --> 19:30.645
And don't you care about me.

19:30.728 --> 19:32.438
Didn't we agree to be cool about it?

19:33.439 --> 19:34.816
Then will you

19:35.942 --> 19:37.443
answer my question...

19:39.946 --> 19:41.864
why you push me away.

19:48.663 --> 19:51.207
You asked if I was seeing someone.

19:52.333 --> 19:54.085
Isn't that too personal a question?

19:54.877 --> 19:56.379
We're at work.

19:56.462 --> 19:59.382
Let's stop talking about that
and stick to work-related stuff.

19:59.465 --> 20:01.259
What if it is work-related?

20:04.554 --> 20:05.722
What does that mean?

20:07.432 --> 20:10.101
Can my love life be work-related?

20:10.184 --> 20:11.269
It can.

20:11.936 --> 20:13.855
Depending on who you date.

20:45.345 --> 20:46.971
He didn't come home.

20:48.056 --> 20:50.016
PROPOSAL: COMPANY MODEL

22:15.852 --> 22:18.479
It's definitely suspicious,
even if I look at it without bias.

22:18.563 --> 22:21.524
Haemu first signed PK
as the company model in 2020.

22:21.607 --> 22:23.693
He was unknown then,
and we paid him 300 million won.

22:26.028 --> 22:28.531
When he resigned in 2021,
the pay soared to one billion won.

22:28.614 --> 22:29.949
ONE BILLION KOREAN WON

22:30.658 --> 22:33.453
I don't see why that's a problem.
He soared to stardom in that year.

22:33.536 --> 22:35.913
Almost any model in his caliber
would be paid that much

22:35.997 --> 22:38.040
- and we demanded a lot of him.
- Yes.

22:38.332 --> 22:39.542
You're right about that much.

22:41.627 --> 22:44.213
But then he's criticized
for poor acting

22:44.297 --> 22:47.091
and excessive commercial use
of his image, diminishing his value.

22:48.092 --> 22:50.011
And still, we renew his contract
for five billion won.

22:50.636 --> 22:53.055
And this deal is for three years,
not the customary one year.

22:53.556 --> 22:56.267
I don't think
we were taken advantage of.

22:56.726 --> 22:59.479
It makes me think he has dirt on us.

23:02.315 --> 23:03.649
But guess what the weirdest thing is.

23:04.233 --> 23:06.235
Around the time
we must decide on a model

23:06.319 --> 23:08.863
Marketing communicates immensely
internally and with agencies

23:08.946 --> 23:11.115
to discuss possible models

23:11.199 --> 23:13.493
and to iron out demands
and requirements.

23:13.576 --> 23:14.744
But when it comes to PK

23:15.620 --> 23:16.788
they did nothing of the sort.

23:17.455 --> 23:19.582
They didn't go to his agency once

23:19.665 --> 23:22.126
and they didn't even correspond
via email.

23:23.169 --> 23:25.046
If what should be there is missing

23:25.129 --> 23:28.049
it can mean something
that shouldn't have been there was.

23:28.549 --> 23:29.634
Yes.

23:31.844 --> 23:32.970
The problem is

23:33.596 --> 23:35.681
how do we prove that?

23:35.765 --> 23:37.225
While you were studying the documents

23:37.308 --> 23:40.478
I went through
PK's social media posts.

23:40.561 --> 23:41.562
What?

23:42.939 --> 23:44.148
You had all the fun.

23:44.732 --> 23:46.025
This must've been fun.

23:46.859 --> 23:48.820
It wasn't. My eyes hurt like crazy.

23:49.320 --> 23:50.863
Don't you see how they're bloodshot?

23:50.947 --> 23:51.989
Where?

24:05.336 --> 24:06.587
Anyway.

24:06.963 --> 24:09.590
PK posted something in March 2020.

24:11.801 --> 24:12.927
It's this photo.

24:13.177 --> 24:14.929
It looked expensively luxurious

24:15.346 --> 24:17.682
so I zoomed in on this window
and looked it up.

24:18.266 --> 24:22.395
It's a crazy expensive
private hot spring in Osaka, Japan.

24:23.020 --> 24:25.690
He's a celebrity, so he would
go on a date at a place like this.

24:26.190 --> 24:27.275
Right.

24:29.277 --> 24:31.028
At around this time

24:31.279 --> 24:33.406
this exact same period

24:34.115 --> 24:36.450
there's a Haemu employee
who used their company card in Osaka.

24:37.577 --> 24:39.328
The transaction
was canceled right away

24:39.412 --> 24:42.790
but I can't say if it was because
she felt a pang of guilt

24:42.874 --> 24:44.709
or because she wanted
to erase her trace.

24:46.711 --> 24:51.090
But Osaka is one of the places
where Koreans love to visit.

24:51.841 --> 24:54.176
It could just be a coincidence.

24:55.887 --> 24:57.263
What if that employee

25:00.057 --> 25:01.601
had the final say in signing PK?

25:03.060 --> 25:04.395
Doesn't that change everything?

25:08.149 --> 25:10.276
TEAM LEADER HAN JI-WON

25:21.203 --> 25:22.496
Are you a slow reader?

25:23.080 --> 25:24.790
You're taking way too long.

25:26.834 --> 25:28.419
COMPANY MODEL: PK
STANDARD CONTRACT

25:28.836 --> 25:30.755
It's okay. Take your time.

25:31.422 --> 25:32.590
Thank you.

25:40.306 --> 25:43.309
We follow the due process
when selecting a company model.

25:44.143 --> 25:45.978
But in PK's case

25:46.062 --> 25:48.147
we've had a long-standing
model-client relationship

25:48.230 --> 25:50.066
and I guess that's why
things were a bit lax.

25:50.524 --> 25:51.525
What about the Japan trip?

25:52.360 --> 25:53.819
That was pure coincidence.

25:54.487 --> 25:57.573
I went there on a family trip
with my two kids and husband.

25:58.491 --> 25:59.825
I used the wrong credit card.

26:00.409 --> 26:04.121
I used it at a convenience store,
but I canceled it right away.

26:05.706 --> 26:07.291
You went with your family.

26:08.000 --> 26:10.044
Can I see the photos you took?

26:11.379 --> 26:14.882
I'd love to show you,
but I got a new phone recently.

26:15.132 --> 26:16.717
I don't have any of the photos.

26:16.801 --> 26:17.885
?Oh, dear.

26:17.969 --> 26:19.929
You lost all the photos of your kids?

26:20.262 --> 26:21.514
You didn't save them
to a cloud server?

26:22.765 --> 26:25.059
I didn't. I'm not that good
with technology.

26:25.643 --> 26:27.186
Let's see your phone.

26:27.520 --> 26:29.021
- What?
- I don't believe you.

26:29.105 --> 26:30.564
Let me see your phone.

26:31.482 --> 26:34.694
Do I have to show you my phone?

26:34.777 --> 26:36.237
It's our due process.

26:36.904 --> 26:38.990
You'll sign a consent form
before handing it over.

26:39.448 --> 26:42.243
Of course,
you can refuse to turn it in.

26:43.077 --> 26:45.788
But that won't do you any good.

26:49.083 --> 26:50.918
It wasn't a family trip.

26:51.210 --> 26:54.422
What Korean mom
takes her kids to a hot spring

26:54.505 --> 26:57.800
in Japan in March, the month
her first kid starts school?

26:58.134 --> 27:00.136
We know your husband didn't travel.

27:00.761 --> 27:02.138
We confirmed it already.

27:19.113 --> 27:20.239
We're dating.

27:22.825 --> 27:23.951
PK and I.

27:26.704 --> 27:27.913
We're lovers.

27:38.758 --> 27:40.885
Ms. Han gave in too easily.

27:41.719 --> 27:43.804
I interviewed her coworkers
beforehand

27:44.388 --> 27:46.223
and they said
she was stubborn and uptight.

27:46.932 --> 27:49.018
I even prepared a few more scenarios
to use against her.

27:50.936 --> 27:51.937
Are you busy today?

28:07.912 --> 28:08.996
Oh, dear.

28:26.055 --> 28:28.682
Min-yul, sit up straight
and wear your seat belt.

28:28.766 --> 28:29.892
It's my turn now.

28:31.227 --> 28:32.770
- I got it.
- You're done for the day?

28:32.853 --> 28:35.272
Come on. Give it back to me.

28:35.356 --> 28:37.441
You won't even say hi to Mom.

28:39.693 --> 28:41.362
Don't run, boys.

28:43.114 --> 28:44.448
Dong-yun, turn that off.

28:44.949 --> 28:47.284
Honey, I'm so very sorry.

28:47.535 --> 28:50.204
I barely shut down my boss
who wanted to go for round two.

28:50.287 --> 28:52.623
- Good for you.
- Dong-yun, you won't even say hi?

28:55.376 --> 28:57.044
Don't you love dumplings?

28:57.419 --> 28:59.547
Can we have some? Try one.

28:59.630 --> 29:01.298
- Leave it.
- Come on.

29:01.382 --> 29:02.883
- Don't be silly.
- Open wide.

29:05.469 --> 29:07.763
They seem to be happily married.

29:07.847 --> 29:09.098
Yes.

29:09.181 --> 29:11.642
- Isn't she too busy to have a lover?
- We'll take a pack.

29:12.685 --> 29:14.478
Thank you. Bye.

29:16.564 --> 29:18.899
Lee Dong-yun.
Quit playing on that phone.

29:21.652 --> 29:23.654
Yes, that one, maybe.

29:36.917 --> 29:38.836
Is Ms. Han really PK's lover?

29:38.919 --> 29:40.337
Is that why she favored him?

29:40.421 --> 29:42.590
Is this the sponsor thing
I'd only heard about?

29:42.673 --> 29:44.717
Where would she get the money for it?

29:44.800 --> 29:47.261
Does she make much more than I
when I'm also a team leader?

29:47.344 --> 29:48.804
- No.
- He said

29:48.888 --> 29:51.348
he was too busy with work to date

29:51.432 --> 29:54.518
and he acted all sweet and naive,
like he only cared for his fans.

29:55.227 --> 29:58.230
I didn't believe every word he said

29:58.314 --> 30:00.024
but isn't this just wrong?

30:00.357 --> 30:04.236
How could he sleep around
with a married mom of three?

30:04.778 --> 30:07.406
The second-hand embarrassment
is killing me.

30:14.663 --> 30:16.290
- What's wrong?
- What are you doing?

30:17.249 --> 30:19.168
Why are you suddenly
cleaning out your drawer?

30:21.086 --> 30:22.504
- What...
- Why...

30:23.756 --> 30:24.965
What's wrong?

30:25.591 --> 30:27.676
- Why the sudden outburst?
- This is...

30:30.095 --> 30:31.430
It's PK's merchandise.

30:32.932 --> 30:35.351
No one can confirm who was in his car

30:35.643 --> 30:38.145
at the time of the accident?

30:38.938 --> 30:40.898
That's right.
No one has any information.

30:40.981 --> 30:42.608
Even the reporters
are getting frustrated.

30:43.525 --> 30:46.195
If Ms. Han is telling a lie...

30:47.321 --> 30:49.782
Why on earth? It would get her fired.

30:50.866 --> 30:53.577
Could there be something
she fears more than losing her job?

31:00.209 --> 31:02.294
I told you
not to over-water the plant.

31:04.755 --> 31:06.507
You told me?

31:07.967 --> 31:09.385
I'm your superior.

31:13.138 --> 31:15.140
It's better to be straightforward.

31:17.142 --> 31:18.269
Put that down.

31:24.275 --> 31:25.693
It doesn't feel right

31:26.527 --> 31:28.612
that Ms. Han is PK's lover.

31:28.988 --> 31:30.739
The women PK dated so far

31:30.823 --> 31:32.825
are idol singer Ha Jeong-yun,
actress Yang Hee-seung

31:32.908 --> 31:35.160
hotel heiress Jo Moon-joo,
and influencer Lee Ji-hyun.

31:35.244 --> 31:36.954
They're all puppy-faced girls

31:37.037 --> 31:39.581
who are relatively short and cute.

31:39.665 --> 31:42.251
But Ms. Han's awfully tall

31:42.334 --> 31:43.794
and she has cat-like features.

31:44.670 --> 31:45.879
Not to mention she's married.

31:46.964 --> 31:48.590
She's not even rich enough
to be a sponsor.

31:49.258 --> 31:51.343
Gosh, Ms. Yoon.

31:52.094 --> 31:54.388
You seem to know a great deal
about PK.

31:56.765 --> 31:57.933
I used to be a fan.

31:59.143 --> 32:00.477
I quit just now.

32:02.730 --> 32:04.940
You must've been a die-hard fan.

32:06.317 --> 32:07.318
Do you know

32:08.402 --> 32:09.695
where to look?

32:10.279 --> 32:12.740
How about rumors among real fans?

32:13.615 --> 32:14.616
Or how about

32:15.200 --> 32:16.994
social media posts about PK?

32:22.458 --> 32:24.793
There's a well-known PK stalker fan

32:25.377 --> 32:26.962
that all the other fans know about.

32:28.380 --> 32:31.300
He said he had photos
from the scene of the accident.

32:31.592 --> 32:33.761
He made a threatening post.

32:33.844 --> 32:35.721
WE'LL PROTECT YOU, PK
STAY STRONG, PK

32:36.555 --> 32:38.474
He might know something.

32:41.602 --> 32:42.853
STAY STRONG, PK
WE'RE BY YOUR SIDE

32:54.448 --> 32:56.408
Are you PK Rabbit?

32:56.492 --> 32:58.285
I recognized your rabbit ears.

32:58.369 --> 32:59.620
They're adorable.

33:02.039 --> 33:03.040
Yikes.

33:09.588 --> 33:12.299
I'm the person who sent you the DM.

33:13.842 --> 33:15.469
I wanted to buy a photo card.

33:15.969 --> 33:17.596
Are you really here for a photo card?

33:18.597 --> 33:20.891
Aren't you from some large company?

33:22.684 --> 33:24.645
I am from a large company,
but how do you know...

33:27.314 --> 33:29.066
Why? What do you want?

33:30.234 --> 33:32.861
What's the matter? What's this about?

33:43.205 --> 33:45.916
The photos I gave you last time
were all I had.

33:46.500 --> 33:48.001
I didn't make any copies.

33:48.544 --> 33:50.379
- And please, mister.
- Yes, what?

33:50.462 --> 33:51.630
I'll quit being a fan.

33:51.713 --> 33:54.007
I won't take any more photos

33:54.091 --> 33:55.801
and I won't follow PK around anymore.

33:56.218 --> 34:00.639
- What's this about? Get up.
- So please, leave me alone.

34:01.348 --> 34:05.310
- I'm not...
- Your company is bullying people!

34:19.366 --> 34:21.535
What company are you talking about?

34:24.872 --> 34:29.751
Aren't you from Sesan Group?

34:31.462 --> 34:32.671
Sesan Group?

34:35.215 --> 34:36.758
These are the originals.

34:37.176 --> 34:38.844
I confirmed there are no copies.

34:47.394 --> 34:48.520
Good job.

34:50.564 --> 34:51.648
Nice one.

34:57.529 --> 35:01.950
Did you really say
you and I were dating?

35:04.036 --> 35:05.913
Did they believe that?

35:07.039 --> 35:08.415
What idiots.

35:11.168 --> 35:13.170
I'll post your husband to Europe.

35:13.921 --> 35:15.130
Flee quietly.

35:37.444 --> 35:39.655
As people say, former fans
can be the scariest haters.

35:42.491 --> 35:43.742
Anyway.

35:44.117 --> 35:46.286
I've been a PK stan for years
while you worked with me.

35:46.370 --> 35:48.247
How come
you never even brought it up?

35:49.248 --> 35:50.249
Gosh.

35:51.959 --> 35:53.001
Ms. Yoon.

35:53.835 --> 35:56.338
I know you aren't looking
to make friends at work

35:57.256 --> 35:58.840
but this one was too harsh.

36:08.475 --> 36:10.143
Isn't this
the exclusive fan club merch?

36:10.936 --> 36:12.312
And it's the first generation.

36:13.647 --> 36:17.067
The resale price for this is crazy.
Why did you throw it out?

36:17.150 --> 36:18.193
That benefits no one.

36:18.277 --> 36:20.529
At least sell it and eat
some tteokbokki with the money.

36:25.200 --> 36:26.243
Well.

36:26.660 --> 36:28.495
I can treat you today.

36:29.538 --> 36:30.956
I sold a few things already.

36:31.957 --> 36:33.208
I'm rich now.

36:42.551 --> 36:43.844
I can never say

36:46.138 --> 36:47.222
no to tteokbokki.

36:49.725 --> 36:50.726
Let's go.

36:52.603 --> 36:54.187
Wait up, Ms. Yoon.

36:54.980 --> 36:57.524
How do you like your tteokbokki?
Made with flour or rice?

36:57.608 --> 36:58.650
I'm a rice girl.

37:00.110 --> 37:02.279
What is it? Tell me.

37:02.571 --> 37:04.823
It seems like you and I have
the same taste in things.

37:05.949 --> 37:07.951
I told you
to carry the ball with you.

37:08.035 --> 37:09.244
You're going to hurt people.

37:09.911 --> 37:11.705
Min-yul! Goodness.

37:18.795 --> 37:19.880
So?

37:21.006 --> 37:22.007
Are you any good at soccer?

37:24.968 --> 37:26.094
Hey.

37:26.219 --> 37:27.721
Go out! And shoot!

37:27.804 --> 37:29.181
Hey, wait!

37:29.598 --> 37:31.391
- Start running.
- Wait for me!

37:31.475 --> 37:32.726
Get the ball!

37:33.393 --> 37:35.687
- Here!
- What are you doing?

37:35.771 --> 37:37.439
What are you doing, man?

37:41.234 --> 37:44.071
Hey, this is cheating!

37:44.154 --> 37:45.530
Stop! I said, stop!

37:46.740 --> 37:48.116
Stand in a line right here.

37:48.533 --> 37:51.203
You aren't supposed
to play dirty, boys.

37:51.286 --> 37:52.412
Play fair.

37:53.205 --> 37:54.414
Isn't that right, Mommy?

37:57.959 --> 38:00.170
Now, go out and play!

38:01.338 --> 38:03.799
- I got it.
- Hey, you can't play alone!

38:03.882 --> 38:05.050
- Wait!
- I'm so tired.

38:13.934 --> 38:16.478
You raise three boys and yet,
you're the Marketing Team Lead.

38:16.728 --> 38:18.313
You're something, Ms. Han.

38:21.900 --> 38:23.360
Plus, you have a guy on the side.

38:24.986 --> 38:26.196
Aren't you going on a date today?

38:30.075 --> 38:32.452
Your husband works
for Sesan Group, doesn't he?

38:35.122 --> 38:37.249
That must've become your weakness.

38:37.499 --> 38:38.834
She doesn't have any power over us

38:39.418 --> 38:41.712
but her influence
can't be ignored at Sesan.

38:52.305 --> 38:54.099
It looks like
you already know everything.

38:55.392 --> 38:56.727
What's your plan now?

38:58.061 --> 38:59.104
What did she say?

38:59.187 --> 39:00.522
We were told to move abroad.

39:01.064 --> 39:02.858
She'll post my husband overseas.

39:04.025 --> 39:05.318
Once I disappear

39:06.194 --> 39:08.572
the case will dissolve because
the person responsible isn't around

39:09.072 --> 39:10.782
and PK will continue to model for us.

39:12.784 --> 39:14.619
Those two will
continue to have an affair

39:14.703 --> 39:15.954
while only you're known as a woman

39:16.997 --> 39:18.415
who slept with a celebrity,
gave him a gig

39:18.498 --> 39:20.417
and then fled abroad
once you got caught?

39:22.335 --> 39:24.463
You're going to be a legend.

39:26.548 --> 39:29.384
So 15 years of diligent service
since the day you began at age 25

39:30.093 --> 39:31.136
comes to nothing?

39:33.013 --> 39:35.807
Well, that kind of rumor
is probably not the worst.

39:37.142 --> 39:39.269
I told your sons
that I was your friend from work.

39:39.853 --> 39:41.605
That kid is Min-uk,
your second son, right?

39:41.897 --> 39:43.190
He asked me

39:43.899 --> 39:45.275
if I were the captain's friend.

39:45.692 --> 39:47.694
He said his mother
was the captain at work

39:49.196 --> 39:52.240
so I should listen to you
and never cause any trouble.

39:53.366 --> 39:56.077
What a caring son you have.
He should be more obedient.

39:56.161 --> 39:57.162
Don't you think?

39:58.205 --> 40:00.582
I told him that I was a team leader,
not a captain.

40:06.505 --> 40:07.547
Do you want help?

40:12.761 --> 40:15.388
I'm a pretty useful shield, actually.

40:17.474 --> 40:18.600
Don't you want to use me?

40:19.392 --> 40:21.978
I promised the boys
that I'd keep the captain safe.

40:36.117 --> 40:37.244
All right.

40:37.327 --> 40:39.496
I'm good now. I've resurrected.

40:40.205 --> 40:42.207
- Come at me again.
- Okay!

41:02.394 --> 41:04.771
- Wait! It's my ball!
- No, it's mine!

41:04.855 --> 41:06.523
Pass it behind you.

41:06.606 --> 41:08.859
Over here! Pass it to me.

41:11.528 --> 41:14.239
Thus, the fundamental issue here is

41:14.322 --> 41:17.701
that Ms. A could pressure Marketing
into showing favor to the model Mr. B

41:17.784 --> 41:20.120
because of the system we created
for advertisement production.

41:21.746 --> 41:24.541
Hence, we propose a measure
to reinforce transparency in the...

41:24.624 --> 41:25.959
Hey, wait a second.

41:27.586 --> 41:28.712
I mean, please.

41:29.129 --> 41:30.380
Who's Ms. A?

41:30.463 --> 41:32.424
I get that Mr. B, the model, is PK.

41:32.507 --> 41:35.427
You have to tell us who Ms. A is.
We're dying to know who it is.

41:35.510 --> 41:37.137
That's not the point of the issue.

41:37.220 --> 41:39.347
Bringing up the actual name
may be considered libel.

41:39.431 --> 41:42.100
Come on. We aren't strangers here.

41:42.183 --> 41:44.060
Libel? Don't make me sad.

41:44.144 --> 41:46.855
We apologize that we could not share
every aspect of the case.

41:47.522 --> 41:49.608
However,
once Ms. A's identity is disclosed

41:49.900 --> 41:52.569
it may create a bigger business risk.

41:52.944 --> 41:54.613
I appreciate your understanding.

41:54.779 --> 41:58.825
Who in the world is it?

42:02.746 --> 42:03.788
Hyun-young.

42:04.331 --> 42:05.832
What brings you here?

42:13.506 --> 42:14.883
Who's Joo In-a?

42:34.110 --> 42:35.987
Who do you think you are to fire PK?

42:36.321 --> 42:38.073
Who do you think you are, you wench?

42:38.156 --> 42:41.368
How dare you fire him?
Who do you think you are?

42:46.581 --> 42:48.750
What are you doing? Let go.

42:49.793 --> 42:50.919
Let go!

42:51.544 --> 42:52.754
I said, let go!

43:04.474 --> 43:07.394
Hey, Jeon Jae-yeol.
Have you lost your mind?

43:07.477 --> 43:09.396
Have you? Answer me!

43:12.190 --> 43:13.858
Who do you think you are to fire PK?

43:13.942 --> 43:15.443
How dare you mess with him?

43:16.319 --> 43:17.445
Didn't you hear me?

43:17.946 --> 43:19.864
Hey, answer me.

43:21.282 --> 43:22.575
Answer me!

43:37.590 --> 43:38.925
Do you think I'm a joke?

43:39.426 --> 43:41.344
It's not even a big deal,
but you blew it up.

43:42.721 --> 43:45.056
Wait, are you jealous? Are you?

43:45.849 --> 43:49.602
Have I ever said anything
about your infidelity?

43:50.729 --> 43:53.231
At the very least, it shouldn't have
impacted my business.

43:53.314 --> 43:55.567
I didn't do anything.
I didn't even take money from him.

43:55.650 --> 43:57.569
All of you are way disgusting,
so you don't get to do this.

43:59.529 --> 44:02.032
Can you say what you just said
in front of your father?

44:02.115 --> 44:04.826
I'll kill myself
if you dare to do that.

44:05.452 --> 44:06.494
Go ahead.

44:07.537 --> 44:08.747
Go ahead and do that if you can.

44:11.624 --> 44:12.834
This time

44:13.835 --> 44:15.170
you crossed the line for good.

44:17.797 --> 44:19.257
Leave the country immediately.

44:19.758 --> 44:21.259
Don't dream of returning for a while.

44:23.261 --> 44:25.638
Hey!

44:48.203 --> 44:50.163
Why does this always happen
to the Head of Audit?

44:50.246 --> 44:52.499
You're always getting beaten up, hurt

44:53.166 --> 44:54.250
and criticized.

44:55.293 --> 44:56.294
That really hurts.

44:56.836 --> 44:58.630
Be more gentle
and leave your feelings out of it.

45:01.716 --> 45:03.843
Now, stay still.

45:09.349 --> 45:10.433
All done.

45:13.645 --> 45:14.979
Gosh, it hurts.

45:15.772 --> 45:16.981
Don't be a drama queen.

45:19.567 --> 45:21.152
What happened to your legs?

45:21.236 --> 45:23.446
One of them is bruised,
and the other is scraped.

45:23.530 --> 45:26.783
These? I got tackled
by Son Heung-min of Mapo-dong.

45:27.408 --> 45:28.952
Wait, you play soccer?

45:29.869 --> 45:31.996
Gosh, you have so many hobbies.

45:33.832 --> 45:35.500
Did you disinfect your legs?

45:35.583 --> 45:37.919
I'm fine. Leave them.
They'll get better soon.

45:41.464 --> 45:42.757
Stay still.

45:51.349 --> 45:53.768
Models aren't supposed to have
any wounds on their bodies.

45:54.561 --> 45:55.895
Where's your work ethic?

46:25.425 --> 46:27.677
About your question, Mr. Noh...

46:31.598 --> 46:33.725
The real reason
why I keep pushing you away...

46:41.024 --> 46:42.025
I...

46:50.241 --> 46:51.367
I...

46:57.040 --> 46:58.541
It's due next week.

46:59.667 --> 47:00.835
Next week?

47:03.713 --> 47:04.756
Mr. Noh.

47:05.006 --> 47:07.967
The one who just left
was Joo In-a, right?

47:08.885 --> 47:10.845
Gosh, were you getting scolded again?

47:10.929 --> 47:12.222
No, you should get to work.

47:17.477 --> 47:18.603
Ms. Joo.

47:23.024 --> 47:24.359
Let me apologize on her behalf.

47:24.442 --> 47:25.568
It's okay.

47:37.080 --> 47:38.122
Hey.

47:44.128 --> 47:45.171
NON-DISCLOSURE AGREEMENT

47:45.255 --> 47:48.091
It's an NDA that says
you will not say anything

47:48.174 --> 47:49.592
about what you've seen today.

47:49.676 --> 47:53.012
But why? Do you think I'll go out
and tell the whole world

47:53.096 --> 47:54.764
that our vice president's wife
is a crazy psycho?

47:54.847 --> 47:56.516
We're just making sure.

47:56.683 --> 47:59.477
Everyone who was there
had to sign this

47:59.560 --> 48:00.937
so don't overthink it.

48:01.479 --> 48:02.981
You can sign it down there.

48:08.194 --> 48:10.154
You didn't expect that
from the vice president, did you?

48:12.073 --> 48:14.784
He looks perfect and sleek
from the outside.

48:15.994 --> 48:17.912
But once you unravel him

48:19.122 --> 48:20.331
he's one weary man.

48:23.751 --> 48:27.297
Well, I guess everyone
has their share of pain.

48:29.382 --> 48:31.801
Is that why you were drawn to him?

48:34.971 --> 48:36.931
You already knew?

48:37.015 --> 48:39.600
Hey, I can take a hint.

48:40.435 --> 48:42.478
That's why you're in charge of PM.

48:43.479 --> 48:45.773
Joo In-a definitely knows
where to place the right people.

48:49.027 --> 48:52.322
- Are we done here?
- I can also take a hint.

48:53.281 --> 48:55.283
What's going on
between Joo In-a and you?

48:57.535 --> 48:58.745
Is there something special?

49:04.083 --> 49:05.460
Where are you suddenly going?

49:05.543 --> 49:07.170
To find out what our relationship is.

49:16.346 --> 49:17.764
- Hey, Doo-gi.
- Yes?

49:17.847 --> 49:19.182
Where's Ms. Joo?

49:19.265 --> 49:21.100
She took the rest of the day off.
Can you believe it?

49:21.476 --> 49:23.061
She never takes a leave all year long

49:23.561 --> 49:24.812
so something must have happened.

49:25.480 --> 49:28.149
Can you also give me
the rest of the day off?

49:28.483 --> 49:29.567
What?

49:31.361 --> 49:33.112
You're suddenly taking
the rest of the day off?

49:33.988 --> 49:37.450
Your call cannot be connected.
You will be redirected to voicemail.

49:38.284 --> 49:39.535
Gosh.

50:05.520 --> 50:07.021
JOO IN-A

50:11.109 --> 50:14.237
Your call cannot be connected.
You will be redirected to voicemail.

50:20.410 --> 50:21.702
MS. JOO...

50:29.001 --> 50:30.753
- Hey, there.
- Hello.

50:31.003 --> 50:32.380
Your face scarred.

50:42.807 --> 50:43.808
REPORTING MS. JOO IN-A

50:43.891 --> 50:45.059
SHE IS INVOLVED IN AN INAPPROPRIATE
WORKPLACE RELATIONSHIP

50:50.148 --> 50:51.232
Could it be...

51:40.281 --> 51:41.282
Let's see.

52:01.093 --> 52:02.136
Joo In-a.

52:05.389 --> 52:06.557
Ms. Joo!

52:52.979 --> 52:54.522
You came, Ms. Joo.

52:55.356 --> 52:57.358
Don't even get me started, Jae-yeol.

52:57.441 --> 52:59.986
She kept insisting on not coming,
so I had to go to her place

53:00.069 --> 53:01.654
and force her to be here.

53:02.196 --> 53:03.239
Mr. Noh.

53:06.909 --> 53:10.454
I know. You were the guy
who gave the presentation.

53:10.538 --> 53:12.081
What brings you here?

53:13.499 --> 53:14.750
Well, the thing is...

53:17.461 --> 53:19.839
I had something urgent
to share with Ms. Joo.

53:26.178 --> 53:28.931
Goodness. What a passionate employee.

53:29.015 --> 53:31.892
You live up to your reputation.

53:31.976 --> 53:33.811
You can take your time
and talk to him, Ms. Joo.

53:33.894 --> 53:35.521
It's a lunch break anyway.

53:35.605 --> 53:37.189
Yes, he came all the way here

53:37.273 --> 53:39.317
so at least let him have
some fresh raw fish. Stay for lunch.

53:40.151 --> 53:41.652
- Yes, ma'am.
- Let's go.

54:00.046 --> 54:02.632
This must be an event
for the executives.

54:03.424 --> 54:04.925
It's held at a nice place.

54:05.509 --> 54:07.011
What's the urgent matter?

54:12.642 --> 54:13.934
Aren't you going to let me have fish?

54:14.602 --> 54:15.936
It's my favorite.

54:20.441 --> 54:23.527
This is so good.
It's so fresh and has a nice texture.

54:24.403 --> 54:26.280
You should have some, too.

54:28.282 --> 54:31.744
No, I should've made
a lettuce wrap for you.

54:31.827 --> 54:35.164
Now, tell me
what the urgent matter is.

54:36.624 --> 54:37.792
Well, you know.

54:38.876 --> 54:39.919
It's been resolved.

54:41.253 --> 54:42.254
In that while?

54:42.755 --> 54:46.092
You traveled this far for a matter
that could be resolved so quickly?

54:46.175 --> 54:48.094
Isn't it great
that it's been resolved quickly?

54:51.222 --> 54:53.724
Now, open up.

54:56.310 --> 54:57.561
You enjoy your food.

54:58.729 --> 55:00.189
Gosh. You're so cold.

55:10.116 --> 55:11.659
You seem to enjoy it a lot.

55:12.618 --> 55:15.162
Wait, did you really come here
to get raw fish?

55:15.371 --> 55:18.499
It's really good, so here.

55:18.958 --> 55:20.334
You should have some, too.

55:20.710 --> 55:22.169
Don't drink soju on an empty stomach.

55:22.545 --> 55:24.380
Or at least let me drink with you.
Here.

55:25.339 --> 55:26.507
Cheers.

55:36.267 --> 55:37.601
That's nice.

55:37.935 --> 55:40.104
So why did you suddenly take
the rest of the day off?

55:40.604 --> 55:42.606
People were surprised
that you did that.

55:42.982 --> 55:45.693
If I returned to the office
after the executive meeting

55:46.652 --> 55:48.028
people would spread rumors.

55:51.741 --> 55:54.535
If the urgency has been resolved,
let's finish eating and go.

55:54.618 --> 55:57.997
Let's take our time.
Mr. Jeon told us you could do that.

55:59.123 --> 56:00.207
I mean

56:00.875 --> 56:02.168
look at this.

56:02.501 --> 56:04.628
It's so nice to see the sea
for the first time in a while.

56:07.465 --> 56:08.632
It's like we're on a date.

56:16.557 --> 56:18.726
Mr. Noh, you're quite a simple guy.

56:27.318 --> 56:30.529
Yes, so keep it simple and finish
what you were going to say.

56:31.280 --> 56:32.823
- Say what?
- The answer

56:34.992 --> 56:36.243
you were about to give me.

56:36.744 --> 56:38.954
About your question, Mr. Noh...

56:40.372 --> 56:42.333
The real reason
why I keep pushing you away...

56:46.128 --> 56:47.171
I...

56:52.176 --> 56:53.344
Oh, that one.

57:04.480 --> 57:05.606
I...

57:21.831 --> 57:22.832
I forgot.

57:24.375 --> 57:27.044
I completely forgot what it was.
I've been so out of it.

57:28.087 --> 57:29.630
Let me try some raw fish.

57:32.550 --> 57:34.593
This place is delicious.

57:34.677 --> 57:36.512
Enjoy, Mr. Noh.
Do you want some soup too?

57:37.012 --> 57:39.765
Excuse me.
Can we have the spicy fish soup?

57:39.849 --> 57:41.267
And two bowls of rice!

57:43.269 --> 57:44.270
Cheers.

57:47.690 --> 57:49.066
Your glass is empty.

57:53.571 --> 57:54.572
Cheers.

58:06.917 --> 58:09.211
That happened at a coffee shop?

58:09.378 --> 58:10.963
I freaked out.

58:11.338 --> 58:13.173
He came over as if he'd punch me

58:13.257 --> 58:16.343
while everyone was watching
then suddenly knelt.

58:18.137 --> 58:20.306
I can imagine
what your face was like.

58:21.724 --> 58:22.850
Oh, my.

58:34.778 --> 58:35.863
Be careful.

58:39.575 --> 58:41.493
Hey. Don't be so cheeky.

58:44.997 --> 58:47.666
- Hands off.
- You tripped first, girl.

58:49.668 --> 58:50.711
"Girl"?

58:51.670 --> 58:53.297
Do you think you're my equal...

59:08.228 --> 59:09.438
Did you really forget

59:10.940 --> 59:12.483
what you were going to say to me?

59:15.486 --> 59:17.404
Why are you so dishonest?

59:25.329 --> 59:26.330
You.

59:26.956 --> 59:27.957
Why did you come here?

59:28.499 --> 59:29.667
What was the urgent matter?

59:34.922 --> 59:36.215
You lied, too.

59:38.050 --> 59:39.051
Wait, it's...

59:40.219 --> 59:41.720
It's embarrassing.

59:42.721 --> 59:45.224
Actually, I came running after you
because I lost my cool.

59:45.808 --> 59:47.559
I went to your place,
saw you get in Mr. Jeon's car

59:47.643 --> 59:49.395
and took it completely the wrong way.

59:50.104 --> 59:52.189
I lost it and raced all the way here.

59:53.148 --> 59:54.233
Isn't it hilarious?

59:54.316 --> 59:55.734
It's not like I'm your husband.

59:56.276 --> 59:57.361
Wait a second.

59:59.071 --> 01:00:00.572
Mr. Jeon and I?

01:00:05.411 --> 01:00:07.496
Was that why you called my name
in that scary tone?

01:00:08.247 --> 01:00:09.957
It sounded like
you wanted to punch him.

01:00:10.040 --> 01:00:11.583
Yes, exactly. I've gone crazy.

01:00:16.630 --> 01:00:18.298
I've lost a bit of my mind

01:00:19.591 --> 01:00:20.634
because of you.

01:00:26.890 --> 01:00:28.350
Stop feigning ignorance.

01:00:29.935 --> 01:00:31.270
You already know.

01:00:35.107 --> 01:00:36.233
You know that I like you.

01:00:41.697 --> 01:00:42.906
Hey, look.

01:00:44.908 --> 01:00:46.160
Where are you going?

01:00:46.952 --> 01:00:48.203
Wait! Come back here!

01:00:52.958 --> 01:00:54.585
You said you liked plushies, right?

01:01:03.052 --> 01:01:05.179
Now, let's get the plushie.

01:01:10.184 --> 01:01:11.769
Grab it. Grab it. Grab it.

01:01:26.408 --> 01:01:29.369
You're trying to get that, right?
Because of the gold bar.

01:01:29.453 --> 01:01:31.080
You're so materialistic.

01:01:32.122 --> 01:01:33.957
Move over. Let me try.

01:01:34.333 --> 01:01:36.502
You aren't
supposed to do this recklessly.

01:01:37.294 --> 01:01:38.587
You need good skills.

01:02:01.819 --> 01:02:03.028
Look.

01:02:04.071 --> 01:02:06.490
Right here, you're going to drop...

01:02:11.662 --> 01:02:12.704
Down.

01:02:14.623 --> 01:02:15.999
You can't win that.

01:02:16.708 --> 01:02:18.001
I can tell that this crane machine

01:02:18.085 --> 01:02:21.046
holds the claws tightly
only for about three seconds.

01:02:21.713 --> 01:02:23.549
And that bear has
metal lumps in its hands

01:02:23.632 --> 01:02:24.883
which makes it too heavy to lift.

01:02:26.844 --> 01:02:28.804
It doesn't matter
if you try 1,000 or 10,000 times.

01:02:29.346 --> 01:02:30.389
You can't win.

01:02:31.723 --> 01:02:35.185
It's not that you're unlucky
or not talented enough.

01:02:36.395 --> 01:02:38.438
It's just programmed that way.

01:02:39.481 --> 01:02:40.691
Something that can't work

01:02:42.359 --> 01:02:43.986
can never work even if you're reborn.

01:02:51.493 --> 01:02:52.828
That's my answer.

01:02:54.580 --> 01:02:55.747
I can't...

01:03:00.085 --> 01:03:01.253
be with you.

01:03:01.962 --> 01:03:03.505
That's just how I'm set.

01:03:05.883 --> 01:03:08.385
First, you're under my authority.

01:03:09.553 --> 01:03:11.680
That already is something
I'm not willing to risk.

01:03:15.475 --> 01:03:16.643
Also, I believe

01:03:18.228 --> 01:03:20.439
you're getting
your feelings confused.

01:03:21.440 --> 01:03:23.442
It's probably curiosity or pity.

01:03:24.359 --> 01:03:25.527
Think about it.

01:03:25.944 --> 01:03:28.280
You've received too much information
about me in a short while.

01:03:28.864 --> 01:03:31.366
You've seen me naked,
and you know about my family.

01:03:32.201 --> 01:03:33.577
You kept seeing me like this

01:03:34.244 --> 01:03:38.081
and began to think,
"She's a poor, lonely woman."

01:03:39.583 --> 01:03:40.792
That's probably it.

01:03:41.627 --> 01:03:43.712
Don't define how I feel about you.

01:03:44.379 --> 01:03:45.923
Well, that was how it began.

01:03:48.008 --> 01:03:49.218
Can you deny that?

01:03:54.348 --> 01:03:55.349
Is that bad?

01:03:56.225 --> 01:03:57.851
Be it pity or curiosity

01:03:58.352 --> 01:03:59.978
the feeling of affection
is all the same.

01:04:00.896 --> 01:04:03.398
Can you label feelings
into one, pity, and two, love

01:04:03.482 --> 01:04:06.193
as if they were elements
on the periodic table?

01:04:06.860 --> 01:04:08.695
Wanting to hold the other person,
missing them

01:04:08.779 --> 01:04:10.989
feeling bad for them, pitying them

01:04:11.073 --> 01:04:13.659
getting curious, and feeling jealous.

01:04:16.954 --> 01:04:18.664
Aren't those
all part of liking someone?

01:04:26.964 --> 01:04:28.840
I don't like feelings
that stem from pity.

01:04:30.050 --> 01:04:32.010
There's nothing more pathetic

01:04:33.595 --> 01:04:34.846
and stickier than that.

01:04:35.931 --> 01:04:38.308
I can't help you
even if you can't accept that.

01:04:40.060 --> 01:04:41.395
Something that can't work

01:04:43.605 --> 01:04:44.773
simply can't work.

01:05:09.756 --> 01:05:12.926
So you two have never fought?

01:05:13.010 --> 01:05:14.177
I'm telling you.

01:05:14.594 --> 01:05:16.638
Actually, I've always been cheeky

01:05:17.139 --> 01:05:18.890
but he always let me win.

01:05:18.974 --> 01:05:20.350
I'm glad to hear that you know.

01:05:23.645 --> 01:05:27.899
Doesn't that mean
you adored the managing director?

01:05:27.983 --> 01:05:29.401
I still find him adorable.

01:05:30.819 --> 01:05:33.947
Oh, my. He must adore you a lot.

01:05:34.448 --> 01:05:36.742
Are you reminded of the old days?

01:05:36.825 --> 01:05:38.285
Yes, of course, he does.

01:05:39.077 --> 01:05:40.162
Are you listening to me?

01:05:41.121 --> 01:05:45.125
Does Jae-yeol choose not to talk
or is he unable to talk?

01:05:52.799 --> 01:05:54.176
Come on.

01:06:05.354 --> 01:06:06.855
Darn it.

01:06:22.371 --> 01:06:25.457
Something that can't work
can never work even if you're reborn.

01:06:26.416 --> 01:06:27.626
That's my answer.

01:06:47.896 --> 01:06:49.648
I apologize
for what happened earlier.

01:06:53.944 --> 01:06:56.029
Oh, about your wife slapping me?

01:06:56.822 --> 01:06:58.532
All I expect
is a lot of salary in return.

01:07:03.787 --> 01:07:04.788
Are you all right?

01:07:05.914 --> 01:07:07.207
It's not a big deal.

01:07:07.833 --> 01:07:10.669
I can take my blows,
so I'm all right.

01:07:19.302 --> 01:07:21.304
I thought you were looking at the sea

01:07:23.140 --> 01:07:24.683
but you were
looking into the darkness.

01:07:28.728 --> 01:07:31.064
This expensive ocean view hotel
is useless at night.

01:07:31.773 --> 01:07:34.401
You can't tell where the sea ends
and where the sky begins.

01:07:35.652 --> 01:07:36.862
It's only dark.

01:07:38.113 --> 01:07:39.823
But you can still feel it.

01:07:41.450 --> 01:07:43.201
The sea breeze blows

01:07:44.077 --> 01:07:45.662
and you can hear the waves.

01:07:57.299 --> 01:07:59.634
Please excuse me. Get a good rest.

01:08:00.427 --> 01:08:01.470
In-a.

01:08:09.811 --> 01:08:11.021
Let go.

01:08:12.689 --> 01:08:13.773
Let go.

01:08:15.734 --> 01:08:16.943
Let go of me.

01:08:17.027 --> 01:08:18.987
One moment. In-a, wait.

01:08:19.070 --> 01:08:20.780
She wants you to let go.

01:08:30.415 --> 01:08:31.416
Let go of her.

01:08:40.967 --> 01:08:42.010
See?

01:08:44.095 --> 01:08:45.347
Something that can't work

01:08:46.598 --> 01:08:47.807
still can work.

01:09:09.955 --> 01:09:12.832
FILING FOR LOVE

01:09:13.500 --> 01:09:16.044
GUEST APPEARANCE BY OH HYE-WON

01:09:41.194 --> 01:09:43.113
Actually, we go way back.

01:09:43.196 --> 01:09:44.864
- It's all in the past.
- I know the vice president

01:09:44.948 --> 01:09:47.117
has feelings for Ms. Joo In-a.

01:09:47.200 --> 01:09:49.911
Is this the vice president's
one-sided feeling?

01:09:50.537 --> 01:09:52.956
Or is there something left
between you two?

01:09:53.039 --> 01:09:55.000
Do you have anyone like that?

01:09:55.083 --> 01:09:57.252
Someone who always takes your side
no matter what happens.

01:09:57.335 --> 01:09:59.170
You have a clinical condition
of acting tough.

01:09:59.254 --> 01:10:01.548
Who cares if you act a little crazy?

01:10:01.881 --> 01:10:03.842
I don't care how long it takes.

01:10:04.342 --> 01:10:06.136
Take a good look at your feelings.

01:10:07.137 --> 01:10:08.430
I'll wait.

01:10:22.277 --> 01:10:24.279
Subtitles by Eunsook Youn
and Jennifer Lim
